  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>pH</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>MHCl</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>MNaOH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><msub><mi>MCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COONa</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>MNaCl</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br />So the order of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>So the order of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pOH</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
